    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency and items earned can be shared with the main game, &quot;Paw Paw Destiny&quot;. If interested, check out the bundle set. If have both, you can play Festival in the main game also (require to launch Festival once)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Purrgatorium Watcher\u3011(board game, 4 min/ a play) </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the judgement of the purgatory between heaven and hell, prevent the escape and invasion of 12 sinners, and become the guardian god in the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[TurnBase * RogueLite * Card * TowerDefence]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027590/extras/d1cf7f83ba8ed29b369cc4f9ca444668.poster.avif?t=1738463071\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027590/extras/d1cf7f83ba8ed29b369cc4f9ca444668.webm?t=1738463071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027590/extras/d1cf7f83ba8ed29b369cc4f9ca444668.mp4?t=1738463071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Pawnishment Card deck\u3011(1,008 cards)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various punishment cards using tickets and edit the title freely. Create your original damage card deck by registering your favorites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Cosmic Paw\u00e2tissier (City build)\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a creative pastry chef in the heavenly realm and feed mankind with delicious and odd civilized sweets. Alter the history of the region in a chaotic way!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027590/extras/87c1f374466fad99253415c325605366.avif?t=1738463071\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010(Cat/Dog) character customization\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 types * many colors for an infinite number of original Edit. dress up and go on the job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027590/extras/6169c4ef4fa0eddf1d301e0ab75235e0.avif?t=1738463071\" width=600 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency and items earned can be shared with the main game, &quot;Paw Paw Destiny&quot;. If interested, check out the bundle set. (If have both, you can play Festival in the main game also)</p>",
